<body>
    <nav class="navbar navbar-dark">
        <div class="container">
            <a class="navbar-brand" href="index.jsp"><i class="bi bi-bag-heart-fill"></i> Lend &amp; Lace</a>
            <a class="btn btn-light btn-sm" href="register.jsp">Back to Register</a>
        </div>
    </nav>
    <div class="container py-5" style="max-width:720px;">
        <h2 class="mb-4"><i class="bi bi-shield-lock"></i> Privacy Policy</h2>
        <div class="card p-4 shadow-sm border-0">
            <h5>What we collect</h5>
            <p>Your name, email address, phone number, address and profile photo are collected
                only to operate dress rental bookings and to contact you about them.</p>
            <h5>Passwords</h5>
            <p>Passwords are stored as salted PBKDF2 hashes and can never be read by our staff.</p>
            <h5>Sharing</h5>
            <p>Your contact details are shared with a dress owner only when you place a booking
                for that owner's dress. We never sell your data.</p>
            <h5>Deletion</h5>
            <p>Contact support@lendlace.example.com to have your account and personal data removed,
                subject to pending bookings.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>

